{"id":"651163","name":"凉拌海带丝","author":"草莓","authorId":"19344","desc":"","cover":"images/651163/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"海带丝","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"30g"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"海带丝提前泡发至软。","img":"images/651163/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中加水烧开把海带丝放入煮熟。","img":"images/651163/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮熟的海带丝捞出，用冷水多冲洗几遍后沥干水分。","img":"images/651163/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入两勺生抽。","img":"images/651163/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入两勺凉拌香醋。","img":"images/651163/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入一勺盐。","img":"images/651163/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入一勺鸡精。","img":"images/651163/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入一勺白砂糖。","img":"images/651163/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量油。","img":"images/651163/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入切碎的小米辣。","img":"images/651163/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入香菜碎搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/651163/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"做好了吗海带丝可以放入冰箱冷藏后再吃，会更加爽口开胃。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}